[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_00_0010","text":"看起来都好好吃……！　那个，那个……！\n……──，就选这个了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_00_0020","text":"哈哈，气氛很热烈啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_00_0030","text":"哦，来得正好\n刚收到巧克力慰问品"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_00_0040","text":"制作人要哪个？\n请选你喜欢的巧克力！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_00_0003","text":"那就\n心形的吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_00_0004","text":"选圆的\n吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_00_0005","text":"有星星形状的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_01_0010","text":"！\n和我选的一样！　你看"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_01_0020","text":"嘿嘿，我们选了一样的呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_02_0010","text":"那个看起来很好吃啊\n再来一个——……有了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_02_0020","text":"巧克力，我也能拿这个吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_03_0010","text":"呵呵，有的哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_03030000_03_0020","text":"星星形状的可是推荐款！"}]
